## graphify Knowledge Graph

This Knowledge Space has a graphify knowledge graph at `graphify-out/`.

- Before answering relationship or architecture questions, read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` for god nodes, communities, and surprising connections
- If `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` exists, navigate it instead of reading raw files
- After modifying wiki content, run `/graphify --update` to refresh the graph
- Use `/graphify query "<question>"` for targeted traversal, `/graphify path "A" "B"` for shortest paths

## Obsidian Vault

This is an Obsidian vault. When editing wiki pages:

- Use `[[wikilinks]]` for internal cross-references (not markdown links)
- All pages require frontmatter: `type`, `title`, `tags`, `related`, `created`, `updated`
- Consult GRAPH_REPORT.md before writing `related:` frontmatter to catch non-obvious connections
- When fetching web content, prefer `defuddle parse <url> --md` over raw HTTP
